{"url": "https://wiki.idlecorp.xyz/api.php?format=json&formatversion=2&action=parse&page=Plastic+factory&prop=text%7Clinks%7Cimages%7Ctemplates%7Ccategories&redirects=1", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-09T14:55:19.267457+00:00", "body": "{\"parse\":{\"title\":\"Plastic factory\",\"pageid\":26,\"redirects\":[],\"text\":\"<div class=\\\"mw-parser-output\\\"><table class=\\\"wikitable\\\" style=\\\"float:right;max-width: 35%;\\\">\\n<tbody><tr>\\n<td><b>Cost</b></td>\\n<td>$5,650, 6,000x <a href=\\\"/index.php/Rubber\\\" title=\\\"Rubber\\\">rubber</a>,<br /> 200x <a href=\\\"/index.php/Steel\\\" title=\\\"Steel\\\">steel</a>, 5,000x <a href=\\\"/index.php/Wood\\\" title=\\\"Wood\\\">wood</a>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b>Total Cost</b></td>\\n<td>$50,000\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b>Inputs</b></td>\\n<td>20x <a href=\\\"/index.php/Crude_oil\\\" title=\\\"Crude oil\\\">crude oil</a>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b>Outputs</b></td>\\n<td>200x <a href=\\\"/index.php/Plastic\\\" title=\\\"Plastic\\\">plastic</a>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b>Production interval</b></td>\\n<td>25 seconds\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b>Production/Min</b></td>\\n<td>480x <a href=\\\"/index.php/Plastic\\\" title=\\\"Plastic\\\">plastic</a>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b>Production/Hour</b></td>\\n<td>28,800x <a href=\\\"/index.php/Plastic\\\" title=\\\"Plastic\\\">plastic</a>\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b>Profit/Sec</b></td>\\n<td>$4.00\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b>Profit/Min</b></td>\\n<td>$240.00\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b>Profit/Hour</b></td>\\n<td>$14,400.00\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b>Return On Investment/Min</b></td>\\n<td>0.47%\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b>Time to ROI</b></td>\\n<td>212,59 Minutes<br />(~4 Hours)\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><b>Aliases</b></td>\\n<td>plastic factory, plasticfactory,<br /> plastic fac\\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n<p>The plastic factory is a facility that produces 200x <a href=\\\"/index.php/Plastic\\\" title=\\\"Plastic\\\">plastic</a> every 25 seconds. It needs to be